    <string name="about_text">MTX Toolbox\nFile manager and tools workbench for Android.\n\nEngines are written in C++17 (NDK/JNI); the Android layer is Java. No Kotlin is used anywhere in this project.\n\nEvery tool shown in this app performs real work: there are no placeholder buttons. Tools still under construction are listed in the project roadmap instead.</string>
